A caption attaches across one blank line

```
|= Fruit |= Price |
| Apple  | $1     |
^ Fruit prices
.
<table>
  <caption>Fruit prices</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Fruit</th><th scope="col">Price</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Apple</td><td>$1</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

